<title>
Rear Skirt Panel Removal and Installation
</title>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The rear skirt panel bolts are precoated with adhesive. If these bolts are reused, they may work loose.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Replace the rear skirt panel bolts with new ones whenever they are removed.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
<attention3>
<ptxt>
The figure below shows condition where the following parts are removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Front fender: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLJA0A9A06005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</attention3>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFJA0P9B0112.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "55.784mm" ver = "01" gw = "227" gh = "142"/>
</figure>
